<doc id="22720" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=22720" title="Warak ireng">
Warak ireng

Warak Ireng (Diceros bicornis) iku &lt;a href="mamalia"&gt;mamalia&lt;/a&gt; sing kalebu ordho &lt;a href="k%C3%A9wan%20kuku%20ganjil"&gt;perissodactyla&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="k%C3%A9wan"&gt;kéwan&lt;/a&gt; asli &lt;a href="Afrika%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Afrika Wétan&lt;/a&gt; lan Tengah, ing nagara-nagara kaya &lt;a href="K%C3%A9nya"&gt;Kénya&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tanzania"&gt;Tanzania&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kam%C3%A9run"&gt;Kamérun&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Afrika%20Kidul"&gt;Afrika Kidul&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Namibia"&gt;Namibia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Zimbabw%C3%A9"&gt;Zimbabwé&lt;/a&gt;. Éwadéné warak iki diarani warak ireng, warnané sajaké &lt;a href="klawu"&gt;klawu&lt;/a&gt; semu &lt;a href="putih"&gt;putih&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng warak ireng iki dipilih kanggo mbédakaké kéwan iki saka &lt;a href="warak%20putih"&gt;warak putih&lt;/a&gt; (Ceratotherium simum). Prakara warna iki bisa dadi kaluputan amarga rong spésies mau pancèn ora bisa dibédakaké &lt;a href="warna"&gt;warna&lt;/a&gt;né. The World Conservation Union (IUCN) mbiwara dhèk surya &lt;a href="7%20Juli"&gt;7 Juli&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt; manawa saprapat &lt;a href="subsp%C3%A9si%C3%A9s"&gt;subspésiés&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Warak%20Ireng%20Kulon"&gt;warak ireng afrika kulon&lt;/a&gt; (Diceros bicornis longipes) dinyatakaké cures. Spésies iki saiki statusé kritis.
