Pratélan ing ngisor iki wujud pratélan &lt;a href="unsur%20kimia"&gt;unsur kimia&lt;/a&gt; kang asalé saka jeneng wong (dijenengaké nganggo jeneng wong). Lambang unsur lan &lt;a href="nomer%20atom"&gt;nomer atom&lt;/a&gt; dituduhaké sajeroning tandha kurung.
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="bohrium"&gt;bohrium&lt;/a&gt; (Bh, 107) - &lt;a href="Niels%20Bohr"&gt;Niels Bohr&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="kurium"&gt;kurium&lt;/a&gt; (Cm, 96) - &lt;a href="Pierre%20Curie"&gt;Pierre&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Marie%20Curie"&gt;Marie Curie&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="einsteinium"&gt;einsteinium&lt;/a&gt; (Es, 99) - &lt;a href="Albert%20Einstein"&gt;Albert Einstein&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="fermium"&gt;fermium&lt;/a&gt; (Fm, 100) - &lt;a href="Enrico%20Fermi"&gt;Enrico Fermi&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="galium"&gt;galium&lt;/a&gt; (Ga, 31) - sanadyan dijenengaké nganggo Gallia (&lt;a href="Basa%20Latin"&gt;Basa Latin&lt;/a&gt; kanggo &lt;a href="Prancis"&gt;Prancis&lt;/a&gt;), penemu logam iki &lt;a href="Lecoq%20de%20Boisbaudran"&gt;Lecoq de Boisbaudran&lt;/a&gt; ngrujuk marang jenengé. Lecoq (pitik jago) sajeroning basa Latin iku gallus.</li>
<li>&lt;a href="hahnium"&gt;hahnium&lt;/a&gt; (105) - &lt;a href="Otto%20Hahn"&gt;Otto Hahn&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng unsur iki ditulak déning &lt;a href="IUPAC"&gt;IUPAC&lt;/a&gt;. Delengen &lt;a href="Kontroversi%20paw%C3%A8w%C3%A8h%20jeneng%20unsur%20kimia"&gt;Kontroversi pawèwèh jeneng unsur kimia&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="lawrencium"&gt;lawrencium&lt;/a&gt; (Lr, 103) - &lt;a href="Ernest%20Lawrence"&gt;Ernest Lawrence&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="meitnerium"&gt;meitnerium&lt;/a&gt; (Mt, 109) - &lt;a href="Lise%20Meitner"&gt;Lise Meitner&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="mendelevium"&gt;mendelevium&lt;/a&gt; (Md, 101) - &lt;a href="Dmitri%20Mendeleev"&gt;Dmitri Mendeleev&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="nobelium"&gt;nobelium&lt;/a&gt; (No, 102) - &lt;a href="Alfred%20Nobel"&gt;Alfred Nobel&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="roentgenium"&gt;roentgenium&lt;/a&gt; (Rg, 111) - &lt;a href="Wilhelm%20Roentgen"&gt;Wilhelm Roentgen&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="rutherfordium"&gt;rutherfordium&lt;/a&gt; (Rf, 104) - &lt;a href="Ernest%20Rutherford"&gt;Ernest Rutherford&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="seaborgium"&gt;seaborgium&lt;/a&gt; (Sg, 106) - &lt;a href="Glenn%20T.%20Seaborg"&gt;Glenn T. Seaborg&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
Asal saka karakter mitos
<ul>
<li>&lt;a href="niobium"&gt;niobium&lt;/a&gt; (Nb, 41) - &lt;a href="Niobe"&gt;Niobe&lt;/a&gt;, tokoh wanita sajeroning mitologi &lt;a href="Yunani"&gt;Yunani&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="prometium"&gt;prometium&lt;/a&gt; (Pm, 61) - &lt;a href="Prometheus"&gt;Prometheus&lt;/a&gt;, Titan sajeroning mitologi Yunani</li>
<li>&lt;a href="tantalum"&gt;tantalum&lt;/a&gt; (Ta, 73) - &lt;a href="Tantalus"&gt;Tantalus&lt;/a&gt;, saka mitologi Yunani</li>
<li>&lt;a href="torium"&gt;torium&lt;/a&gt; (Th, 90) - &lt;a href="Thor"&gt;Thor&lt;/a&gt;, saka mitologi bangsa &lt;a href="Norwergia"&gt;Norwergia&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>&lt;a href="titanium"&gt;titanium&lt;/a&gt; (Ti, 22) - &lt;a href="Titan"&gt;Titan&lt;/a&gt;, saka mitologi Yunani</li>
