<doc id="23551" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23551" title="Kemis">
Kemis

Kemis iku dina kalima sajeroning &lt;a href="kal%C3%A8ndher%20Jawa"&gt;kalèndher Jawa&lt;/a&gt;, sawisé &lt;a href="Rebo"&gt;Rebo&lt;/a&gt; lan sadurungé &lt;a href="Jemuwah"&gt;Jemuwah&lt;/a&gt;. Jeneng kemis dijupuk saka &lt;a href="basa%20Arab"&gt;basa Arab&lt;/a&gt; khamsa, kang tegesé lima.
