Port Said

Port Said (&lt;a href="Basa%20Arab"&gt;Basa Arab&lt;/a&gt; بورسعيد,
&lt;a href="alih%20aksara"&gt;alih aksara&lt;/a&gt; Būr Sa&amp;#699;īd)
