<doc id="23979" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=23979" title="Sagara Ireng">
Sagara Ireng

Sagara Ireng iku &lt;a href="sagara"&gt;sagara&lt;/a&gt; kang dumunung ing antarané &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt; kidul-wétan lan &lt;a href="Asia%20Cilik"&gt;Asia Cilik&lt;/a&gt; utawa &lt;a href="Anatolia"&gt;Anatolia&lt;/a&gt;. Sagara iki kahubung karo &lt;a href="Sagara%20Tengah"&gt;Sagara Tengah&lt;/a&gt; déning &lt;a href="Selat%20Bosporus"&gt;Selat Bosporus&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Sagara%20Marmara"&gt;Sagara Marmara&lt;/a&gt;, lan karo &lt;a href="Sagara%20Azov"&gt;Sagara Azov&lt;/a&gt; déning &lt;a href="Selat%20Kerch"&gt;Selat Kerch&lt;/a&gt;.
Ana lebon banyu saka sagara Tengah liwat Selat Bosporus watara 2000&amp;nbsp;km³ per taun, déné lebon banyu tawa saka tlatah saubengé, mligi saka Éropa Tengah lan &lt;a href="W%C3%A9tan%20Tengah"&gt;Wétan Tengah&lt;/a&gt;, gunggungé watara 320&amp;kmsup3; per taun. Kali paling wigati kang banyuné lumebu ing Sagara Ireng ya iku &lt;a href="Kali%20Donau"&gt;Kali Donau&lt;/a&gt;. Sagara Ireng nduwèni wewengkon 422.000&amp;nbsp;km² lan jero maksimum 2.210 m.
Nagara kang wewatesan karo Sagara Ireng ya iku &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bulgaria"&gt;Bulgaria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Romania"&gt;Romania&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Georgia%20%28nagara%29"&gt;Georgia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Ujung%20Krim"&gt;Ujung Krim&lt;/a&gt; ing Républik Otonomi Ukraina.
Kutha wigati ing pesisir kalebu: &lt;a href="Istanbul"&gt;Istanbul&lt;/a&gt; (biyèn &lt;a href="Konstantinopel"&gt;Konstantinopel&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Bizantium"&gt;Bizantium&lt;/a&gt;), &lt;a href="Burgas"&gt;Burgas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Varna"&gt;Varna&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Constanta"&gt;Constanţa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Yalta"&gt;Yalta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Odessa"&gt;Odessa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sevastopol"&gt;Sevastopol&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kerch"&gt;Kerch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Novorossiysk"&gt;Novorossiysk&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sochi"&gt;Sochi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sukhumi"&gt;Sukhumi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Batumi"&gt;Batumi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Trabzon"&gt;Trabzon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Samsun"&gt;Samsun&lt;/a&gt;.
