<li>Nemtokaké tapel wates &lt;a href="Flight%20Information%20Region"&gt;Flight Information Regions (FIR)&lt;/a&gt;, lan wigatiné tumrap kendhali aktivitas montor mabur militèr,</li>
<li>Isu status &lt;a href="demilitarisasi"&gt;demilitarisasi&lt;/a&gt; tumrap sawatara pulo-pulo Yunani ing Aegea,</li>
<li>Usul Ankara bab konsèp "zona klawu".</li>
</ul>
